    {
      "id": "dice-scope",
      "observation": "Case Dice averages labels present in the reference, excluding background. A predicted-only class is omitted from that class mean; an all-background reference returns 1 even with nonempty prediction. The nonclinical fixtures reproduce this, distinct from whole-foreground clDice.",
